{
 "id": "link-hints-cost-wiki-20",
 "priority": "P1",
 "title": "Measurement: 20 times plain f, wait 1 s, Escape on en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States; the journal's link-hints focus-check and targets times",
 "why": "Measurement for reopen-f4 and the lead (#32537 review point 3): the cost of the link-hint page check on a heavy real page. No click on the page body: a CuaDriver click into a Chromium page cannot be delivered on the minis (STATUS 7302, 7362); after the address-bar load the page has the keyboard with no field focused.",
